From: Marionette AirDrop driver research
Subject: [EXPERIMENTAL] use complete monitor filters only inside bounded slots

0016 radiotap CHANNEL observation confirms actual raw frames on 2437, 5220
and 5745 during ROC-aligned capture, with 54 frames and no AWDL. Restricting
the temporary capture filters to hardware other-BSS classification may omit
broadcast action frames classified as filter-pass. During the synchronous
0015 capture phase only, retain the existing full monitor filter categories.
Outside that phase, keep 0013 other-BSS filters and 0014 normal RX restore.
The <=200ms bound, STA association, vdev guard and synchronous restore remain.
No RAW TX, firmware changes or background work. Verify actual AWDL receipt
and ordinary Wi-Fi loss/latency; frame counts alone are insufficient.

